=product @PRODUCER@ @BASE@ LIBXML2 @PCSIVERSION@ full
1 'PRODUCER
=prompt @PRODUCER@
1 'PRODUCT
=prompt libxml2 @VERSION@ (XML library, clang build) for OpenVMS
1 'NOTICE
=prompt libxml2 is distributed under the MIT licence.
1 RELEASE_NOTES
=prompt Documentation is in [LIBXML2.DOC]README.VMS under the installation directory.
1 POST_INSTALL
=prompt Post-installation tasks for libxml2
    At system startup: to define LIBXML2$ROOT at every boot, add this line to
    SYS$MANAGER:SYSTARTUP_VMS.COM:
    $ @SYS$STARTUP:LIBXML2$STARTUP.COM
    Building against libxml2 (clang only): compile with
    -I/libxml2$root/include -names2=shortened and link with
    LIBXML2$ROOT:[LIB]LIBXML2.OLB/LIBRARY.

PRODUCT REMOVE LIBXML2 removes the product and deassigns LIBXML2$ROOT.
